/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  CASE-LOCAL chemistry -- the Edwards (1978) parameterisation of the second
  carbonate equilibrium (Table 1, HCO3- row), formation direction (see
  NH3aq-formation.dat for why the whole network is the paper's).

      HCO3- = H+ + CO3=       a -12431.7  b -35.4819  c 0  d 220.067
  CO3 = HCO3 - H is exactly that dissociation, so the coefficients carry
  over directly (divided by ln 10).
  Check: logK25 = -10.332 against the PHREEQC record's -10.329.
